ained to establish the cyberpunk noir setting.\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video adopts a cinematic, photorealistic cyberpunk noir style with high-contrast lighting and wet surface reflections.\n[Shot 1] The scene opens in a narrow, deep East Asian urban back alley at night during heavy rain. <Subject 2> establishes the environment: wet dark grey brick walls line both sides, cluttered with aging pipes, AC units, and metal awnings. The ground is uneven with shallow puddles reflecting cyan, purple, and faint warm orange neon lights. The camera is positioned at a low angle, approximately 60cm from the ground, tracking steadily forward from about three meters behind <Subject 1>. <Subject 1>, the female mechanic, walks away from the camera toward the alley's vanishing point, positioned slightly left of center. She wears a dark blue knee-length waterproof trench coat, a low-saturation orange scarf, dark grey cargo pants, and black waterproof boots. Her short silver-grey hair is visible from the back. Only her right hand is covered by a black mechanical glove; her left hand is bare. She walks with a steady, slightly weary but alert pace. Her right arm hangs naturally, while her left arm swings gently. Each step of her black boots into the puddles creates restrained splashes and outward-spreading ripples. Fine rain falls continuously, beading on the surface of her blue coat. The hem of the coat sways naturally with her stride. A side-rear wind causes the orange scarf to flutter continuously toward her left rear, and her silver hair moves slightly in the breeze while maintaining its shape. As she passes a cyan light box mounted on the right wall, the light flickers due to poor contact, briefly illuminating her right shoulder, coat, and the wet ground. Distant white steam drifts slowly in the background without obscuring her. Suddenly, a clear but not violent metallic collision sound comes from a dark corner on the right. Hearing this, she does not turn immediately but